# TENDRILS — before the tendril portal. Unlocks the Strong Will upgrade by
# setting the flag it requires (see upgrades/strong_will.tres).

letterbox on
camera 2640 -420 1.4
say fairy "That portal is reaching for us. If it gets hold of you, it won't let go."
say mafia "And if it does?"
say fairy "Struggle. Mash jump. Or yell for me and I'll yell for you to shoot it."
if upgrade heavy_rounds
	say mafia "Heavier rounds today. It won't hold on for long."
else
	say mafia "Shoot the arm, not the hole. Got it."
end
camera_reset
set_flag seen_tendrils
narrate "New upgrade unlocked: Strong Will. Press U."
letterbox off
